@startuml
!include style.iuml
' Pre-exam readiness check (Core/Readiness/ReadinessPolicy, Services/Readiness/ReadinessCheckService,
' DashboardViewModel.RunReadinessAsync / RetryReadinessItemAsync / ReportReadinessAsync /
' ConfirmAttendanceAsync / UpdateStartEligibility, Core/Dashboard/StartGate, ExamsController.SubmitReadiness / OpensAt)
' Print sizing (D6): large font at dpi 96, so PlantUML's fixed pixel gaps stay small next to the text;
' printed size = 22 * (printed width in pt) / (PNG width px), at least 7 pt at the width used in Chapter 5.
skinparam dpi 96
skinparam defaultFontSize 22
skinparam ArrowFontSize 22
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam padding 1
skinparam swimlane {
  TitleFontSize 23
}
skinparam defaultTextAlignment left

|Desktop App|
start
:GET /api/exams/student/current
(exam requirements); the student
presses Run check;
repeat
  :ReadinessCheckService runs 7 checks:
  <b>Network</b>: best round trip <= 2 s
  <b>ClockSkew</b> <= 60 s from the server
  <b>ScreenCapture</b>: the screen can be captured
  <b>Camera</b> (a): a frame that is not dark, one face (YuNet)
  <b>Microphone</b> (a): a device is present
  <b>SecureMode</b> (b): one monitor if BlockMultiMonitor,
     no remote session, no VM, keyboard hook works
  <b>Disk</b> >= 200 MB free
  (a) only if the exam requires it; (b) skipped if lockdown Off
  Retry re-runs only the failed item; all results are re-sent;
  |Server|
  :POST /api/exams/{id}/readiness:
  ExamsController recomputes
  passedAll, saves ReadinessCheck,
  audits READINESS_PASSED or
  READINESS_FAILED, pushes hub
  "ReadinessUpdated";
  |Desktop App|
repeat while (passedAll, or\nRequireReadiness off?) is ([no: fix it,\npress Retry]) not ([yes])
if (Checked in?) then ([no])
  :Press Check In
  (Attendance event);
else ([yes])
endif
:Start Exam is enabled once the exam opens
(StartTime - EarlyJoinMinutes), the student is
eligible and on the right seat; the pass stays valid
30 min, else student/start returns READINESS_REQUIRED;
stop
@enduml
